  "excited_witness_readme": "The [sealed core three-state review](../mps_excited_seed_review/REVIEW.md) independently verifies exact staggered source contractions and excludes the fixed one-Rayleigh D26 recipe for every beta\u22650 at denominator lengths **n=14,16,20**. At **n=24**, the unresolved closed-box union is **[13/2,45/4] = [6.5,11.25]**; outside it the specified recipe is excluded. An optimistic upper orbit surviving inside the window does not certify realizable denominator bounds, actual startup or a physical gap. The three denominator witnesses have Sz=0,+1,\u22121 and are orthogonal fixed trials, not certified eigenvectors or a certified triplet. Ground MPS bond D=26 and single-source bond upper bound 52 are distinct from three linear witnesses and full Hilbert dimensions 3^n / 3^(2n). Exact physical tests through n6, source contractions through n24 and ground contractions through n48 are sealed. Historical core retained; both sealed extensions are included separately in stage9. [Exact upper-envelope rows](excited_witness_upper_envelopes.csv).",
  "stage7_publication": {
    "commit": "fb38f57548c86d9dda19450e68cbbedbafd6765a",
    "tree": "de52aaf8e91dad68ccdc9e74f2fce0368be78212",
    "evidence": "parent reported verified remote main publication; not a local Git checkout claim"
  },
